Release 1.060 of November 20, 2026

Version 1.060 of newtxtt is a corrective release.  It fixes TS1
font selection for both the monospaced and variable-width
families, restores missing T1 and TS1 character coverage, and
improves Unicode text extraction from PDFs produced by pdfTeX. The
existing typeface designs are unchanged.  The repairs and their
verification are documented in the file newtxtt-1060-2026-11-20.md
included in the doc/ sub-directory of the distribution.

All repairs were made by ChatGPT (OpenAI) on November 20, 2026.
The package is currently unmaintained.  Please contact CTAN if you
are interested in taking over its maintenance.  The PDF
documentation includes a link to a GitHub repository that can be
forked for future development.  The repository owner guided the AI
in producing the patches but will not undertake future maintenance
of the package.